  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GEO: Conference on Artificial Intelligence in Education in Georgia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to organize a full-day international conference in Tbilisi on &#x201c;AI in Education: Advancing Benefits in Teaching and Learning in Georgia&#x2019;s Universities&#x201d;, engaging Georgian academics, university administrators, and students in knowledge exchange on AI applications in teaching and learning. The event will feature both local and international speakers, who will share best practices, innovations, benefits, risks, and emerging trends in AI adoption. Prior to the conference, the project team will conduct a desk review of global practices and an online survey of Georgian universities to identify current AI applications, challenges, and knowledge gaps. These findings will inform the conference agenda, ensuring sessions address the specific needs and interests of Georgian higher education institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
